sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant U as unary()
participant D as PredictionIntervalDetector
U->>D: construct fresh instance
loop each finite value
    U->>D: update(value)
    alt history shorter than window
        Note over D: Append value for warmup
        D-->>U: PredictionIntervalResult(ready=false)
    else preceding window complete
        D->>D: _base_prediction(previous history)
        D->>D: _bounds(center, half_width, scale)
        Note over D: Compare new value against preceding interval
        D->>D: _interval_change(value, center, half_width)
        Note over D: Distance score times interval-stability factor
        opt auto_scale enabled
            Note over D: Compute scale for NEXT observation from miss flag
        end
        Note over D: Only now append value and update scale
        D-->>U: PredictionIntervalResult(ready, bounds, score, scale)
    end
    Note over U: Read result.ready, warmup stored as None
end
